# Architecture

- Dependency flow: `views/widgets → viewmodels → store → repositories → data`
- `models`, `repositories`, `utils` must not import React or Zustand
- `views` must not import repositories or `data/` directly
- `widgets` are presentational; business logic lives in viewmodels/utils
- Prefer small reusable widgets over monolithic screen files
- No `any` — use proper TypeScript interfaces
- Path alias `@/` maps to `src/`
